gular foramen tumors with intracranial extension</article-title><source>Otol Neurotol</source><year>2004</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>570</fpage><lpage>579</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15241237</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00129492-200407000-00026</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Peker</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Bayrakli</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Kili&#x000e7;</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Pamir</surname><given-names>MN</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Gamma-knife radiosurgery in the treatment of trigeminal schwannomas</article-title><source>Acta Neurochir (Wien)</source><year>2007</year><volume>149</volume><fpage>1133</fpage><lpage>1137</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17728994</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00701-007-1285-9</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>